    "inclusion_heading": "We value digital inclusion",
    "inclusion_body": "In our effort to help provide a fully accessible and optimized experience for our website visitors, {{ site }} has taken careful measures to help ensure an enhanced user experience, whether the website visitor is using assistive technologies such as a screen reader, magnifier, or other assistive technology to access the website.",
    "monitoring_body_html": "This website is monitored and tested by {{ audioeye_link }}, a third-party provider of web accessibility testing and monitoring. Results of automated testing are reported to {{ site }} in the AudioEye platform. Further, to the extent {{ site }} engages AudioEye for expert review, remediation and user testing by people with disabilities, AudioEye either remediates discovered issues or provides a Source Feedback Report (SFR) for {{ site }} to remediate the issue. Finally, AudioEye continually improves and refines its existing solutions.",
